{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"712961","name":"Le Trente","description":"استمتع بسحر فندق Hotel Le Trente، الواقع في الدائرة السابعة عشرة في باريس. استفد من وسائل الراحة مثل خدمة الواي فاي المجانية، ومقهى الوجبات الخفيفة، وبوفيه إفطار يومي (متوفر مقابل رسوم). يوفر الفندق 31 غرفة ضيوف مجهزة بميني بار، وقنوات رقمية، وحمامات داخلية مع لوازم استحمام مجانية. كما تتوفر خدمة استقبال على مدار 24 ساعة، وطاقم عمل متعدد اللغات، وخدمة تخزين الأمتعة. تشمل مناطق الجذب السياحي القريبة Moulin Rouge وParc Monceau وPlace de Clichy، وكلها على مسافة قصيرة.","address":"30 Rue Clairaut","city":"Paris","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"75017","lat":48.8883052,"lng":2.3195594,"stars":3,"giataCode":"599212","phone":"+33143132930","email":"FERIAL@LETRENTEHOTEL.COM","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_l_003.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_l_004.jpg","category":"lobby","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_l_005.jpg","category":"lobby","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_l_006.jpg","category":"lobby","order":9},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/71/712961/712961a_hb_l_001.jpg","category